      "content": "a pause sounds nice but a pause implies there is something left to come back to. i don't see that. i look at the last two decades and i just see a massive hole where my life should have been. it's like i've been bankrupt for years and i'm just now realizing i have nothing left to trade. it feels like i'm just dragging around a corpse of a life.",
